1
00:00:00,738 --> 00:00:03,578
(Sheldon(outside):)Knock, knock,
knock, Penny?

2
00:00:03,641 --> 00:00:06,881
(Sheldon(outside):)Knock, knock, knock, Penny?
Knock, knock, knock, Penny?

3
00:00:09,214 --> 00:00:10,314
(Penny:)What's this?

4
00:00:10,381 --> 00:00:11,581
(Sheldon:)Leonard told me what happened,

5
00:00:11,649 --> 00:00:14,449
(Sheldon:)so I took it upon myself
to make you a hot beverage.

6
00:00:14,519 --> 00:00:16,119
(Penny:)Oh. That's so sweet of you.

7
00:00:16,187 --> 00:00:17,717
(Sheldon:)Yeah. I know.

8
00:00:18,822 --> 00:00:20,192
(Sheldon:)Turns out, being sweet

9
00:00:20,257 --> 00:00:22,727
(Sheldon:)isn't enough
to keep a girl these days.

10
00:00:22,792 --> 00:00:24,792
(Sheldon:)I blame Madonna.

11
00:00:24,861 --> 00:00:27,801
(Penny:)I'm sorry to hear
about you and Amy.

12
00:00:27,864 --> 00:00:29,264
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm sorry
about Leonard.

13
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:30,813
(Sheldon:)Thought I raised him
better than that.

14
00:00:30,867 --> 00:00:33,937
(Penny:)You know, it's bad enough
what happened,

15
00:00:34,004 --> 00:00:36,544
(Penny:)but then he tried to hide
the fact that he sees her

16
00:00:36,607 --> 00:00:38,477
(Penny:)all the time
at the university.

17
00:00:38,542 --> 00:00:40,872
(Sheldon:)He does? Who is it?

18
00:00:40,944 --> 00:00:43,214
(scoffs) Some girl named Mandy.

19
00:00:44,047 --> 00:00:46,377
(Sheldon:)Mandy Chao?
Yeah.

20
00:00:46,449 --> 00:00:48,119
(Sheldon:)Oh, you don't need
to worry about her.

21
00:00:48,184 --> 00:00:49,314
(Sheldon:)She's brilliant and attractive.

22
00:00:49,385 --> 00:00:56,025
(Sheldon:)She can do way better
than Leonard.

